": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le04ob01re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "If you're going to move into the future with your home appliances, soon you'll have a lot of ultramodern gadgets to choose from. I don't mind waiting for new innovations, do you?\nIf you wait for that new stove, you'll  be able to change the way you cook altogether  with heatless cooking. Stores in the U.S. are anticipating getting this technology soon. If you are wondering what it is, you'll be finding out right here.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "Consider cooking on a stove with electromagnetic currents in the burners that make the metal pots and pans hot.  If you use an induction cooktop, just the pot you are using and what's inside will heat up. Imagine taking a pan off the stovetop and then being able to put your hand on the cool glass surface. Choose an induction stove if you want the heat to be generated from the pan rather than from the stovetop.", "time": "21500"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "We'll need a holographic TV if we're going to keep up. A new company is proposing finding ways to refresh holographic images faster. With this you will enjoy seeing things move and look  as they should. If we're going to have holographic TVs for the consumer market, the new, quick refresh rates will have to work and keep working. Keep looking for them at a store near you!<br/><br/>We are also recommending waiting for the hero of the century, the waterless washing machine. Get one of these if you want to save on water! Xeros reports their machines  using 90% less water than other conventional machines. If you're going to do that, you need to clean using their nylon polymer beads. These beads are more absorbent than water, allowing them to absorb stains right into their core.", "time": "44000"}], "video_src": "engenn11le04ob01re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}